{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>Threads 爆紅「紫菜吞拿魚卷」</h2>\n<p>Threads 近期掀起「紫菜吞拿魚卷」熱潮，被稱為「平價減肥針」或「天然瘦瘦針」。這道料理材料平價、做法簡單，基本組合只需紫菜、吞拿魚、水煮蛋，再按喜好加入青瓜、粟米或毛豆，將餡料拌勻後放上紫菜摺起即可，亦可加入少量無糖乳酪或其他醬料調味。\n</p>\n<h2>高蛋白質＋高水分及膳食纖維</h2>\n<p>這款食譜巧妙利用了「高蛋白質＋高水分+高膳食纖維」的天然飽腹組合，而非真的具有減肥針的藥物效果。 吞拿魚及雞蛋提供蛋白質，有助促進飽足訊號；青瓜水分高，粟米含膳食纖維，能增加餐點份量；紫菜代替部分麵包或餅皮，可降低熱量。不過，短期體重下降亦可能受水分、肝醣、鹽分攝取與整體飲食改變等因素影響，並非單靠這道料理就能保證瘦下來。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179268482464293219_4425082606ada3319745c3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179268482464293219_4425082606ada3319745c3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：AI生成圖)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179268482837393050_18437593746ada331ca04df.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179268482837393050_18437593746ada331ca04df.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：AI生成圖)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179268483024475039_5795415836ada331e74ca6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179268483024475039_5795415836ada331e74ca6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：AI生成圖)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DezMqTFEzXn/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:36.985461+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":415,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fal